em-41\"><a href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/gift-vouchers/\">Gift Vouchers</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-40\"><a href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/about-us/\">About us</a></li>\n<li class=\"menu-item menu-item-type-post_type menu-item-object-page menu-item-39\"><a href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/about-us/contact/\">Contact us</a></li>\n<li class=\"c-search-toggle menu-item menu-item-type-custom menu-item-object-custom menu-item-4699\"><a href=\"#\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i> Search</a></li>\n</ul>\t\t\t\t    \t\t\t\t</nav>\n\n\t\t\t</section>\n\n\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\t\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"page-body-wrap\">\n\n\t<main class=\"global-wrap\">\n\n<section class=\"c-prod__masthead c-prod__section  u-has-bg-color u-amber-bg\">\n    <div class=\"o-max o-max--1400 fadeIn\">\n        <div class=\"o-layout o-layout--large\">\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n                <figure class=\"c-fig c-prod__img\">\n                                            <img src=\"https://assets.cadoganhall.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/260910_LOTR.jpg\" alt=\"The Music of The Lord of The Rings\" title=\"The Music of The Lord of The Rings\"/>\n                                    </figure>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n\n                <h1 class=\"c-prod__heading\">The Music of The Lord of The Rings</h1>\n\n                <div class=\"c-prod__meta\">\n\n                                            <p class=\"c-prod__subheading\">A Tribute to Howard Shore</p>\n                    \n                                            <p class=\"c-prod__date\"><span>Thursday 10 September 2026, 7.30pm</span></p>\n                    \n                    \n                                            <p class=\"c-prod__prices\">\n                            Prices from &pound;25.00 to &pound;40.00                        </p>\n                    \n                    <div class=\"c-event-buttons__row\">\n                        <a class=\" c-btn c-btn--book\" data-button=\"book\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/the-music-of-the-lord-of-the-rings/book/1282034\">Book Now</a>\n                                                                                                </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <ul class=\"c-jump-nav\">\n    <li><a data-scroll href=\"#details\">Details <i class=\"fas fa-angle-down\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n    \n    \n    </ul>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"c-prod__stick-nav  u-has-bg-color u-amber-bg\">\n\n    <ul class=\"c-jump-nav\">\n    <li><a data-scroll href=\"#details\">Details <i class=\"fas fa-angle-down\"  aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></a></li>\n    \n    \n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"stick-nav__right\" id=\"performances-button\">\n        <span class=\"stick-nav__title\">The Music of The Lord of The Rings</span>\n        <a class=\" c-btn c-btn--book\" data-button=\"book\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/the-music-of-the-lord-of-the-rings/book/1282034\">Book Now</a>    </div>\n</section>\n<section id=\"details\" class=\"o-row c-prod__info c-prod__section u-white-bg\">\n    <section class=\"o-max o-max--1400\">\n        <div class=\"o-layout o-layout--large o-layout--reverse\">\n\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n\n                <section class=\"c-prod__details\">\n                                            <section class=\"c-prod-boxout o-box c-prod__details c-prod__programme-wrap  u-has-bg-color u-amber-bg\">\n                            <div class=\"prod__programme\">\n                                <p class=\"c-small-label\">Programme</p>\n                                <p><strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Fellowship of the Ring<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> Bag End<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Shire<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> Farewell, Dear Bilbo<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> Saruman, the White<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> Gollum<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Mirror of Galadriel<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Houses of Healing<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Grace of Undomiel<br />\n<strong>Enya</strong> May It Be<br />\n<strong>Howard Shore</strong> The Road Goes Ever On</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                                                                <section class=\"c-prod-boxout o-box c-prod__details c-prod__performers-wrap  u-has-bg-color u-amber-bg\" >\n                            <div class=\"prod__performers\">\n                                <p class=\"c-small-label\">Performers</p>\n                                <p><strong>Mystery Ensemble</strong> (soprano, two violins, viola, cello, oboe &amp; piano)</p>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                                                                <section class=\"c-prod__details c-prod__links-wrap c-prod__links-wrap--desktop c-content-style\">\n                            <div class=\"prod__links\">\n                                <p class=\"c-small-label\">Related Links</p>\n                                <p><a href=\"https://redevents.world/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">redevents.world</a></p>\n                            </div>\n                        </section>\n                                    </section>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n\n                <div class=\"c-content-style\">\n                                        <p>Experience the majestic music of the legendary <em><strong>Lord of the Rings</strong></em> films in a breathtaking concert that will transport you into the heart of Tolkien’s universe.</p>\n<p>Howard Shore’s iconic soundtrack has captivated millions across the world – and now, RedEvents brings it to life in a spellbinding performance that includes vocal music inspired by Elvish songs, ancient folklore, and the poetic spirit of Middle-earth.</p>\n<p>Performed by the modern orchestra <strong>Mystery Ensemble</strong>, this immersive evening guides you through a journey where elves sing, hobbits dance, and the shadows of Mordor loom in the distance. Alongside the orchestra, live vocals by <strong>Josephine Shaw</strong> embody the voices of Tolkien’s world – from ethereal Elvish laments to the haunting chants of ancient realms.</p>\n<p><em>Recommended age: 7+</em></p>\n                </div>\n\n                                    <p class=\"c-prod__duration\"><strong>Duration: </strong>approx. 2 hours (incl. interval)</p>\n                \n                \n                                    <section class=\"c-prod__details c-prod__links-wrap c-prod__links-wrap--mobile c-content-style\">\n                        <div class=\"prod__links\">\n                            <p class=\"c-small-label\">Related Links</p>\n                            <p><a href=\"https://redevents.world/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">redevents.world</a></p>\n                        </div>\n                    </section>\n                \n                                \n                <div class=\"c-share\">\n                                                                        <div class=\"addtocalendar\">\n    <var class=\"atc_event u-hidden\">\n        <var class=\"atc_date_start\">2026-09-10 19:30:00</var>\n        <var class=\"atc_date_end\">2026-09-10 22:30:00</var>\n        <var class=\"atc_timezone\">Europe/London</var>\n        <var class=\"atc_title\">The Music of The Lord of The Rings</var>\n        <var class=\"atc_description\">A Tribute to Howard Shore</var>\n        <var class=\"atc_location\">Cadogan Hall or one of the supported venues. Please contact the box office for more details.</var>\n    </var>\n</div>\n                                                                <div class=\"sharethis-inline-share-buttons\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </section>\n</section>\n<section class=\"o-row c-prod__ticket-info c-prod__section c-prod-boxout o-box  u-has-bg-color u-amber-bg\">\n    <section class=\"o-max o-max--1400\">\n        <div class=\"o-layout o-layout--large\">\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n                <section class=\"ticket-panel__info c-content-style\">\n                    <p class=\"c-small-label\">Ticket Information</p>\n                                            <div class=\"c-prod__price-list\"><p>£40, £35, £30, £25</p>\n</div>\n                                                                <div class=\"c-prod__pricing-notes\"><p><strong>A single £4.50 transaction fee applies to all online bookings (per order, not per individual ticket). </strong>Orders made in person at the box office are exempt from transaction fees. See <a href=\"http://cadoganhall.com/your-visit/booking-information/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">booking information</a> for details, payment methods and delivery options.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/hire-the-hall/seating-plans/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Check out the view from your chosen seat</a> on our interactive seating plan.</p>\n</div>\n                                                                <a class=\" c-btn c-btn--book\" data-button=\"book\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/the-music-of-the-lord-of-the-rings/book/1282034\">Book Now</a>                                    </section>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/2@tablet\">\n                                                            </div>\n    </section>\n</section>\n    <section class=\"c-construkt\">\n\t</section>\n    <section class=\"o-row c-prod__related c-prod__section u-white-bg\" id=\"related\">\n        <section class=\"o-max o-max--1600\">\n            <h3