ook Now</a>            </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/4@tablet u-1/4@desktop\">\n                        <div class=\"c-event-item\">\n    <a class=\"c-event-item__link-wrap\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/gareth-malone-sing-a-long-a-gareth-at-the-movies/\">\n        <span class=\"u-hidden-visually\">\n            Gareth Malone        </span>\n    </a>\n\n    <figure class=\"fig\">\n            <img class=\"lazyload\"\n        src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\"\n        data-src=\"https://assets.cadoganhall.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/261129_gareth1.jpg\"\n        alt=\"Sing-A-Long-A-Gareth at the Movies\"\n        title=\"Sing-A-Long-A-Gareth at the Movies\"/>\n        </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"c-event-item__content\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-event-item__heading\">Gareth Malone</h3>\n                    <p class=\"c-event-item__subheading\">Sing-A-Long-A-Gareth: At The Movies</p>\n                            <p class=\"c-event-item__date\">Sunday 29 November 2026, 4pm</p>\n                                    <div class=\"c-event-item__excerpt u-smallprint o-max--600\">Gareth Malone – the man who got the nation singing – is back on the road with Sing-A-Long-A-Gareth: At The Movies, a brand-new live show celebrating the unforgettable songs that have helped make movie moments magical. From sweeping cinema classic...</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"o-row c-event-buttons__row\">\n            \n                \n    <div class=\"c-event-buttons\">\n        <a class=\"c-btn c-btn--ghost\" data-button=\"more-info\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/gareth-malone-sing-a-long-a-gareth-at-the-movies/\">More Info</a>\n                    <a class=\" c-btn c-btn--book\" data-button=\"book\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/gareth-malone/book/1334634\">Book Now</a>            </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"o-layout__item u-1/4@tablet u-1/4@desktop\">\n                        <div class=\"c-event-item\">\n    <a class=\"c-event-item__link-wrap\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/zios-2026-27-taiwan-philharmonic-1/\">\n        <span class=\"u-hidden-visually\">\n            Taiwan Philharmonic        </span>\n    </a>\n\n    <figure class=\"fig\">\n            <img class=\"lazyload\"\n        src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAAAAACH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\"\n        data-src=\"https://assets.cadoganhall.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/270327_ZIOS_Markl.jpg\"\n        alt=\"Jun Märkl. Photo by Tat Keng Tey.\"\n        title=\"Jun Märkl. Photo by Tat Keng Tey.\"/>\n        </figure>\n\n    <div class=\"c-event-item__content\">\n        <h3 class=\"c-event-item__heading\">Taiwan Philharmonic</h3>\n                            <p class=\"c-event-item__date\">Saturday 27 March 2027, 7.30pm</p>\n                                    <div class=\"c-event-item__excerpt u-smallprint o-max--600\">A thrilling ride through our solar system to a galaxy far, far away, via sci-fi film scores and highpoints of Holst’s orchestral classic.\nThe Taiwan Philharmonic, one of Asia’s finest orchestras, has travelled the furthest across our planet of al...</div>\n        \n        <div class=\"o-row c-event-buttons__row\">\n            \n                \n    <div class=\"c-event-buttons\">\n        <a class=\"c-btn c-btn--ghost\" data-button=\"more-info\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/zios-2026-27-taiwan-philharmonic-1/\">More Info</a>\n                    <a class=\" c-btn c-btn--book\" data-button=\"book\" href=\"https://cadoganhall.com/whats-on/zios-taiwan-philharmonic/book/1318635\">Book Now</a>            </div>\n</div>\n    </div>\n</div>\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n        </section>\n    </section>\n\n</main>\n<div id=\"signup-mod